@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About – DailyGames</PageTitle>

<h1>About DailyGames</h1>
<p>
    DailyGames helps you keep track of the daily puzzles you love: Wordle, Connections, Strands and many more.
    Tick off each game when you're done, build streaks, and never miss a day.
</p>
<p>
    DailyGames is an independent fan project. It only links to the games. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by
    any of the games or their publishers, and all game names belong to their owners.
</p>

<h2 id="support">Support the site</h2>
<p>
    DailyGames is free and has no account wall. If it makes your mornings a bit better, you can
    <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/premoderncollection" target="_blank" rel="noopener">buy me a coffee</a> to help keep it running.
</p>

<h2 id="privacy">Privacy</h2>
<p>
    Your games and streaks are stored <strong>only in your own browser</strong> (localStorage). Nothing is sent to a server,
    and there is no account. Clearing your browser data deletes it, so use <a href="games">Export</a> to make a backup.
</p>
<p>
    We don't use tracking cookies right now. If ads or analytics are added later, you will be asked for consent first,
    and this page will be updated.
</p>
